00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.805
Mirrors reflect light

2
00:00:01.805 --> 00:00:30.075
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Mirrors reflect light. Smooth mirror light ko reflect karta hai, isliye usme image dikh sakti hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:30.075 --> 00:01:03.158
Mirror ko window se aane wali roshni ke paas rakho, par bright beam aankhon mein reflect na karo. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:03.158 --> 00:01:37.444
Adult ke saath mirror aur rough paper compare karo; kis par clearer reflection dikhti hai? Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

